# Local scratch
local/

# Repo-root scratch families that tend to leak onto the default branch: one-off
# handoffs, per-session implementer specs, overnight runner scripts. Root-anchored
# (leading /) so they never shadow a legitimate nested file (docs/**/SPEC_*.md,
# scripts/*.sh). The HARD gate is tests/template/test_root_hygiene.py's root-file
# allowlist; this just keeps the common scratch out of `git status` / `git add`.
/HANDOFF.md
/SPEC_*.md
/run_*.sh
